{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0344_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6e53a38908a66703809e7cedbb7a542796eaf4df7b0e8bb8e481a3b1c292c86a", "ja": "（『和とアイドル』をテーマにしたポスターに、\n翼が選ばれた。今日はその撮影日だが……）", "zh": "（翼被选为了以“和与偶像”为主题的海报模特。今天就是拍摄日，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0344_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ac71f004766b1719a75b79ba2ad1aa91843b4835540f5c2651073d686b3725c1", "ja": "あ、カメラマンさん。表情なんですけど、\nあんまりニコニコしない感じでもいいですか～？", "zh": "啊，摄影师先生。关于表情，我可以不要笑得那么灿烂吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0344_1002_camman", "source_sha256": "81794023cd3a2ba12345b7edeafcb87afc321147ac89b294d8243f2dcc37bb96", "ja": "おっ、そうだね！\n少し大人っぽい雰囲気で撮ってみようか！", "zh": "哦，说得对！\n要不要试着拍出稍微成熟一点的感觉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0344_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3bd539df1325f2361e90a84aad8a893805685a2cc73c1c007a8f241105acfe48", "ja": "は～い！　ちょっとやってみま～す。\nえっと……こんな感じで、どうですか？　ふふっ♪", "zh": "好～的！我来试试看～。\n那个……像这样，怎么样？呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0344_1004_camman", "source_sha256": "cf506489a89a661fcd11023a669f8ea5ef59852143dd6769676ea5d720b54987", "ja": "おお！　いいよ、翼ちゃん！\nその調子で、どんどんポーズしてみて？", "zh": "哦哦！可以啊，小翼！\n就保持这个状态，试着不断摆出姿势吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0344_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "06bac7a6dc49731b28b8b2f8c20c3001c8a5a3fb720d4afe9bee5f8ba6c77f14", "ja": "ふぅ……。{$P$}さん、\nお疲れさまでーす！　撮影、見ててくれました～？", "zh": "呼……{$P$}先生，\n辛苦啦！刚才一直在看拍摄吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0344_1007_p", "source_sha256": "8698361433b64333bcc1cde4268e94e1ce802dfc45ed8308ab036cabf153df45", "ja": "もちろん。スムーズに進んでびっくりしたよ。\nこの調子で後半も頼むな！", "zh": "当然了。进展顺利得让我都吃了一惊呢。\n后半程也保持这个势头拜托你啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0344_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "94f88a08748b5ff97ae2bc32a5c973942e678d1c080e7537bd58bc59a9799b1c", "ja": "えへへ、やった！\n{$P$}さんにもほめられちゃった♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，成功啦！\n还被{$P$}先生夸奖了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0344_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3976f9beec967a30a52eaabb933cdb9902d71b90b6f7c8574dc667551da4f6b8", "ja": "カメラマンさんにも、い～っぱいほめてもらったし。\nなんか今日のわたし、絶好調かも！", "zh": "摄影师也夸了我好多好多呢。\n感觉今天的我，状态好得不得了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0344_1010_p", "source_sha256": "27d3e732d5d076603c9d86c1f01869126b0aa28b4a7a8c9525cbf17c1119b043", "ja": "ああ、俺もそう思ったよ。\n撮影のために、何か準備でもしたのか？", "zh": "啊，我也这么觉得。\n为了拍摄，你是不是做了什么准备？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0344_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "df1f13f5d9325b8bac125f0417d2de5498cf8e16428a71ce7ba745def511d83c", "ja": "え？　準備、ですか……？\nん～……わたし、何かしたかな～？", "zh": "咦？准备吗……？\n嗯～……我做过什么吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0344_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "69d0b7828a6c99024c09cda407e10d688f8c8f9f0ac894430a82d9645c163eba", "ja": "テーマを聞いて、それっぽい雑誌は見た気がするけど。\n雑誌のポーズを、ちょっとマネしたり？", "zh": "听说主题后，我好像看了些相关的杂志。\n还稍微模仿了一下杂志上的姿势？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0344_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "fa8d7c2b11151b40b664f662b2b278a4fe903b1e549fd24e34338cf084c63a42", "ja": "でもでも、やったのはそれくらいですよ？\nあとはこの場所に合わせて、なんとなーく……。", "zh": "不过不过，我也就做了这些吧？\n之后就是配合这个地方的感觉，随随便便地……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0344_1014_p", "source_sha256": "7c362ff8186e99edd9dfeb15e4f0f7fa05f98f68aeb1951e40535f17718cc0d1", "ja": "……場所の雰囲気に合わせて、か。\n翼も撮影に慣れてきたってことかな？", "zh": "……配合场地的氛围啊。\n这说明翼也习惯拍摄了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0344_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4d613af284d40fb8a53a10a9a501c2f9ce09941552db2d5c26b24de456c795a9", "ja": "うんうん。きっとそうです！\nさっきのオトナな雰囲気も、似合ってたでしょ♪", "zh": "嗯嗯。一定是这样！\n刚才那种成熟的氛围，也很适合我吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0344_1016_p", "source_sha256": "38bb4fb7a60a4e0398ea95ba45c0b6cf71163932c0327bbab0f93e5bace8a894", "ja": "そうだな。翼は活動的なテーマが合うと思ってたけど。\n今後は、落ち着いた雰囲気の仕事も増やしてみるか。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。我本来觉得翼适合活泼的主题，不过今后也试着多接一些风格沉稳的工作吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0344_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "192b67b75466f23bd2280f7867bd36fa1a7dd7b4f576cb655a1ff8bf79430ec2", "ja": "ホントですか！？　うれしい～♪\nじゃあじゃあ……今のわたし、美人だって思います？", "zh": "真的吗！？好开心～♪\n那么那么……你觉得现在的我，是个美人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0344_1018_p", "source_sha256": "77f0d998baa72a28f46f7a110e93159144f7d55c4b9b111178c22066492952aa", "ja": "…………もちろん。\nすごい美人だと思うよ。オトナっぽい美人？", "zh": "…………当然了。\n我觉得你是个大美人哦。成熟风的大美人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0344_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3c776bd4956e92a2337cf6c17ab1b8c8eee13327c5463873449c26eafeda4049", "ja": "え～……適当に言ってません？\nもっと本気でほめてくださいよ～！", "zh": "诶～……您是不是在随口敷衍我呀？\n请更认真地夸夸我嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0344_1020_p", "source_sha256": "4ccecf80992b3eb7f9aec804ad67689d8ac82d040e88245bb83e33217dfc5d73", "ja": "ほ、本気で？　いや、まだ仕事中だからな……。\nあ！　もうすぐ休憩時間が終わりみたいだ！", "zh": "认、认真？不，我现在还在工作呢……\n啊！休息时间好像马上就要结束了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0344_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6c0e2612f49e97380d1a3c88cd99c30fc426a158d5342ca54407484a682d737d", "ja": "それじゃ、{$P$}さんに宿題！\nわたしが今聞きたいほめ言葉、考えておいてください！", "zh": "那么，就给{$P$}先生布置作业！\n请想好我现在想听到的夸奖！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0344_1022_p", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0344_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "859150efbe87ba0b159c2378afd91651c3bba771e823be4ef9d8bbe903ece0d8", "ja": "撮影が終わったら、答え合わせしましょ～♪\nうん。なんだか、すっごくやる気が出てきたかも！", "zh": "拍摄结束后，我们来对答案吧～♪\n嗯！不知怎么的，好像干劲十足起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0344_1024_016tsu", "source_sha256": "884a1d3f0539af7906f2c28c7360f4e443fafcbe178f0a8aef0833c9bfaf77b5", "ja": "見ててくださいね、{$P$}さん！\nこの後も、バッチリ決めちゃいまーす。えへへ♪", "zh": "请看好了，{$P$}先生！接下来我也会好好发挥的——。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
